+# Order search (service desk)
+
+The desk screen calls `GET /orders/search` with a customer name fragment, an
+optional status and a page number. It replaces the OrderStatusServlet lookup
+that went through the SalesOrder entity bean.
+
+## Behaviour
+
+- Cancelled orders are hidden unless `includeCancelled=true`.
+- Pages hold 25 rows. The first page is page 1.
+- Totals are shown in whole currency units.
+- Orders over 5,000.00 are flagged for a supervisor.
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Path | Purpose |
+| --- | --- |
+| `GET /orders/search` | search by name fragment and status |
+| `GET /orders/search/tiles` | order counts per status for the dashboard |
